{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50231","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 井辘轳 · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 井辘轳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有幸奉陶甄，时行即转圆。\n从绳每合辙，遇坎本（奉）[一]周旋。\n□是循环正，何曾汲引偏。\n已承钧轴力，不虑坠诸泉。\n（[一]依刘校。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}